{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20745","headline":"萧宅二三子赠答诗二十首 石荅竹 · 卢仝","name":"萧宅二三子赠答诗二十首 石荅竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石报孤竹君，此客甚高调。\n共我相共痴，不怕主人天下笑。\n我非蛱蝶儿，我非桃李枝。\n不要儿女扑，不要春风吹。\n苔藓印我面，雨露皴我皮。\n此故不嫌我，突兀蒙相知。\n此客即西归，我心徒依依。\n我欲随客去，累重不解飞。\n知弟虚心亦待客，此客何以共报之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}